"testvsr" COMMENTS
================

******************* Step to run this test *******************************

1. make -f makefile.man all

2. testvsr.sh

    the result will be on "testvsr.SRr0".  The log will be on "testvsr.SLr0"
    The test will require the user to prepare 3 tapes that
    have been written by "testvsw".  The user will need to put the 3 tapes on
    the 4980 cabinet and load the first tape onto the drive.  Then the user
    will need to hit the return.  


   THE TEST TAKES ~2 MINUTES TO RUN; 

